### Drone workflow

Design the system to support the following real workflow:

1. User creates a drone mission.
2. The system stores mission parameters.
3. Drone captures images.
4. Images are uploaded to Supabase Storage.
5. Image metadata is stored in the database.
6. GPS coordinates and timestamps are extracted or received.
7. Images are sent to the image-processing pipeline.
8. Processing results are stored.
9. Results appear on the field map.
10. User receives a notification.

### Important

Do not claim that the platform controls a physical drone unless an actual drone SDK or flight-controller integration exists.

If direct drone integration is not configured, support manual image upload and clearly distinguish it from an actual automated flight.

Do not present simulated mission progress as a real drone flight.

